[{"text":"LeviCivita[mu, nu, rho, si] is an input function for the totally antisymmetric Levi-Civita tensor. It evaluates automatically to the internal representation Eps[LorentzIndex[mu], LorentzIndex[nu], LorentzIndex[rho], LorentzIndex[si]] (or with a second argument in LorentzIndex for the Dimension, if the option Dimension of LeviCivita is changed).","anchor":"levicivita"},{"text":"LeviCivita[mu , nu, ...][p, ...] evaluates to Eps[LorentzIndex[mu], LorentzIndex[nu], ..., Momentum[p], ...].","anchor":"levicivita"},{"text":"The shortcut LeviCivita is deprecated, please use LC instead!","anchor":"levicivita"},{"text":"Overview, LC, FCI.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"LeviCivita[\\[Alpha], \\[Beta], \\[Gamma], \\[Delta]]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\bar{\\epsilon }^{\\alpha \\beta \\gamma \\delta }\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"LeviCivita[][p, q, r, s]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\bar{\\epsilon }^{\\overline{p}\\overline{q}\\overline{r}\\overline{s}}\\]","anchor":"cb2-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"LeviCivita[\\[Alpha], \\[Beta]][p, q]","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\bar{\\epsilon }^{\\alpha \\beta \\overline{p}\\overline{q}}\\]","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"LeviCivita[\\[Alpha], \\[Beta]][p, q] // StandardForm (*Eps[LorentzIndex[\\[Alpha]], LorentzIndex[\\[Beta]], Momentum[p], Momentum[q]]*)","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"LeviCivita is scheduled for removal in the future versions of FeynCalc. The safe alternative is to use LC.","anchor":"cb4-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"LC[\\[Alpha], \\[Beta], \\[Gamma], \\[Delta]]","anchor":"cb5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\bar{\\epsilon }^{\\alpha \\beta \\gamma \\delta }\\]","anchor":"cb5-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"LC[][p, q, r, s]","anchor":"cb6","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\bar{\\epsilon }^{\\overline{p}\\overline{q}\\overline{r}\\overline{s}}\\]","anchor":"cb6-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"LC[\\[Alpha], \\[Beta]][p, q]","anchor":"cb7","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\bar{\\epsilon }^{\\alpha \\beta \\overline{p}\\overline{q}}\\]","anchor":"cb7-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"LCD[\\[Alpha], \\[Beta], \\[Gamma], \\[Delta]]","anchor":"cb8","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\overset{\\text{}}{\\epsilon }^{\\alpha \\beta \\gamma \\delta }\\]","anchor":"cb8-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"LCD[][p, q, r, s]","anchor":"cb9","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\overset{\\text{}}{\\epsilon }^{pqrs}\\]","anchor":"cb9-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"LCD[\\[Alpha], \\[Beta]][p, q]","anchor":"cb10","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\overset{\\text{}}{\\epsilon }^{\\alpha \\beta pq}\\]","anchor":"cb10-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCI[LC[\\[Alpha], \\[Beta], \\[Gamma], \\[Delta]]] === LeviCivita[\\[Alpha], \\[Beta], \\[Gamma], \\[Delta]]","anchor":"cb11","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{True}\\]","anchor":"cb11-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCI[LCD[\\[Alpha], \\[Beta], \\[Gamma], \\[Delta]]] === LeviCivita[\\[Alpha], \\[Beta], \\[Gamma], \\[Delta], Dimension -> D]","anchor":"cb12","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{True}\\]","anchor":"cb12-1","section":"Examples"}]